WEBVTT

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:13.080
Hit by a bullet, Kosame was at death's door.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.830
I lost my way as the rain poured down.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.080
Don't scare me like that, Kosame!

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.450
Our hope now restored,
we rush to resume the race!

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:23.450
Wait for us, Sofia!

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.790
C'mon, please!

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:05.250
Just let me go! I have a wife and kids!

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:09.620
Oh, is that right? You poor guy.

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:12.410
One of you kill the other.

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:15.000
Do it and I'll set you free.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.330
Are you kidding?!

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:22.660
Pick up the gun, take aim,
and pull the trigger. That's all there is to it.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:28.660
Don't you wanna see your family?
If you're a man, fight for your freedom.

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:30.500
No! Don't listen to--

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:36.410
Don't!

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:51.120
This is why I love people so much!

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.200
Get lost.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:00.410
Don't you want your freedom, too?

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.410
Why would you do that?

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:05.910
Because I have the power to.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.330
The world is simple.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:12.290
The strong live and the weak die.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:17.200
We conquer, hurt, steal, and kill.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:24.830
If you don't like it, stop me.

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:28.250
But that takes power, right?

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:31.200
Your way is wrong!

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:35.370
Don't disagree with me. Next time, you're dead.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:41.870
The only reason you're safe with me
is 'cuz you're my property now.

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:44.000
If not for my power,

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:49.370
you'd be a plaything for
hungry Snakes till the day you die.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.580
Al...

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.910
"Episode 12"
"WE WILL STOP YOU!!"

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.450
"Episode 12"
"WE WILL STOP YOU!!"
It's just as good as it was before.

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:11.250
It's just as good as it was before.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.200
Thanks.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.410
Yes, sir!

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:21.580
Sounds good!

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:24.580
We're done over here, too!

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:29.040
TJ and the Bad Brothers are good to go whenever.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.000
All that's left...

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.250
Hototo!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.250
Okay!

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:44.160
Oof!

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:46.540
We're finished.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:47.620
Okay.

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:50.080
Th-Thanks.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:54.120
That's one awesome car.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.620
Ain't it?

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:02.580
What a hodgepodge.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:04.450
I like it that way.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.080
Looks like it's fixed.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:08.830
No, it's reborn.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:13.040
What's that part for?

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.330
Lights out.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.950
From what the police told us,

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:52.160
Gil ditched the train
about 90 kilometers away

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.290
and is hiding out in a nearby ghost town.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.750
The hostages are likely with him.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:01.290
I collected some of the ransom.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:06.660
It's not the full amount, but let's hope
it's enough to free the hostages.

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.370
I want to avoid fighting if we can.

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.540
That all depends on him.

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:13.160
How many are there?

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:17.200
100 at the very least. Probably more.

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:19.040
I get to kill Gil.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:22.160
Just in case, I prepared guns and ammo.

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:23.950
Ooh, thanks!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:27.410
The National Guard is assembling in Chicago.

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:30.160
Does anyone think we should wait for them?

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.950
You have to ask?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:36.290
If they ride in, the ghost town
will become a battlefield.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.750
We've gotta save Sofia before that.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.700
I get to kill Gil.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:43.370
But there's more than 100 of them!

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:46.200
Meanwhile, we've got women and children--

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.080
Women?

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:50.080
Eek!

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.540
Children?

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:56.660
J-Just so you know,
I haven't really shot a gun before!

00:06:56.660 --> 00:07:00.080
We've got a pair of
the Thousand Three on our side.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.160
We're fine with nine people.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.540
--Not nine.
--Huh?

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:05.580
Ten.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.000
Kosame!

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:09.580
Are you okay?

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:13.370
Yup! The wound's closed and all wrapped up!

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:19.250
Just stay and rest till the race is
back on. You'll get in our way.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:23.160
Even with a hole in my stomach,
I bet I'm more helpful than you.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:27.120
Wha...?! You wanna taste of my new weapon?

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.620
Enough. No fighting.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:34.790
I won't push myself. Don't worry.

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:37.620
Now we're the Ten Braves.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.370
Suit yourself.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.750
There's one little problem.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:05.160
Since it'll take days to repair the bridge,
we have to go around.

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:06.950
What about my thing?

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:12.040
I had materials taken to the bridge
and had it made. But what's it for?

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:15.870
Didn't I tell you? My car was originally a ship.

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:57.620
They're on high alert.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:01.750
Wh-What now? I'd really like
to avoid a fight and rescue--

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:02.870
We know.

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:05.580
We don't need no stupid plan.

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:10.540
Let's walk right in and kick Gil's ass.
Anyone in the way dies.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:13.250
Huh?! S-Someone stop him!

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.910
Good grief. You stole my idea.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:18.200
You're kidding! It's too reckless!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:22.160
No, the rest of us can use them as a diversion.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:27.370
Right. Once the fighting starts,
we'll sneak in and find the hostages.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:31.950
In that case, let's split up.
I've got something good.

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:33.450
Smoke signals?

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:38.660
Yeah. White if you find the hostages.
Red if you run into Gil.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:42.450
Go towards white and run away from red, right?

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:46.200
What if there's white <i>and </i>red?

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:49.790
It's dangerous to go alone.
Let's break into pairs.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:54.370
It'd be smart to have a fighter
and thinker on each team.

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:56.370
Who here's a fighter?

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.330
Who here's a thinker?

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:05.160
Forget it. Let's try to balance our strengths.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.700
We're ready to roll whenever.

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:12.910
Hototo.

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:16.540
Be a good boy.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:17.660
Squeak?

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:21.290
Squeak?

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:24.700
Alrighty. Just try not to die.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:27.160
It's time! Onwards!

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.500
Five bucks if you miss!

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:34.790
You know he will.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:36.370
This'll shut you up.

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:39.540
You suck.

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:41.040
--Watch this.
--Tsk!

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.870
Hey, whatcha doing?

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:50.950
Who's there?!

00:10:57.040 --> 00:11:00.000
Stay out of our way, maggots.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.290
You're dead.

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:03.250
The Thousand Three!

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:13.040
Don't waste booze.

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:17.040
It's the Thousand three!

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:18.830
--Go around back!
--Kill 'em!

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.250
--It's begun.
--Good, let's go.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:30.330
They're gathering forces in Chicago.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:33.500
There's probably 800 to 1,000 men.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:38.080
Just like we thought,
there's a festival going on in Chicago.

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:42.040
"Chicago, Illinois"
It's the perfect stage for our plan.

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:46.120
The men are waiting as we speak.
Just give the order and--

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:47.700
Why?

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:53.330
"The Trans-America Wild Race Continues!"
Why hasn't the race been canceled?

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:58.120
I thought I crushed their hopes
and destroyed their cars.

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:03.040
Intruders! Two of the Thousand Three
came into the city--

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.000
Kill 'em.

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:08.700
Did you not hear me? Go and kill 'em.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.250
But...!

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.830
U-Understood!

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:20.000
The tragedy that's yet to come
was to be sweetened by their despair.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.830
That's why I let 'em live.

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:28.250
Whatever. I'm sure Al Lyon
and the others came along, too.

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:33.120
Make a mountain of their bodies
in the middle of town

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:37.540
as a monument to symbolize
my terror and power!

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.790
Go and deal with them.

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:40.750
Yes, sir!

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:44.830
It's a warm-up for the festival!
Slaughter them all!

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.660
Please stop!

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:52.120
Lucky you gets a front-row seat
to witness what's to come.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:57.200
Sofia? Sofia!

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.830
What the hell?!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.450
You little...!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:03.700
Anyone who points a gun at a kid

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:05.620
is a bad boy!

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:13.790
Hey.

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:15.040
What the?

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:20.700
It's our lucky day! What's a woman
like you doing in a place--

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.000
Weren't we avoiding fights?

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:31.040
What I said was, "Keep it quiet."

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:33.750
--There's more intruders!
--Find 'em!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.330
Good. Let's move.

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.160
Found 'em!

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:44.290
Shit!

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.200
I shall take you on!

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:55.160
What about your new weapon?

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:58.080
That's my trump card to stop Gil.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.500
I see.

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:06.790
Now, you die.

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:09.450
Consider this a show of mercy.

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.200
I'll slaughter you!

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:21.790
A woman, huh?

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.200
I don't wanna hear it!

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:27.200
Where the hell you think you're going, grandpa?!

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:30.500
Who you calling grandpa?! I'm only 35!

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:31.500
Huh?

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:41.500
Hey! Where's Gil at?!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:46.950
I-If I betray Gil, he'll butcher my family!

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:51.290
Shit! There's no end to 'em!

00:14:55.450 --> 00:15:00.910
Each shot fires multiple bullets.
It's low penetration but high accuracy.

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:05.080
This isn't the time to analyze!
We can't even get close!

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:07.540
Where's Sofia?!

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:12.200
Give it up, boy. She's not your woman anymore.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:17.160
By now, she's probably screaming your name
while the men have their way--

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:18.580
You bitch!

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:29.750
Al, go ahead! I can handle her myself!

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:31.620
--But...!
--Use your head!

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:34.200
It's all to save Sofia!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.450
Thanks!

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:40.830
You sure? Your girly weapons won't work on me.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.620
Girly weapons?

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:45.870
You mean this?

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:53.330
Don't run now.

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:54.830
The rest is up to you.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.500
Huh? But...!

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:59.290
I'll show you what men are made of!

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:02.040
Pathetic.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:14.000
What the hell?

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:19.250
What the hell?!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.790
You're kidding...

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:26.870
Just shut up and die, dumb-ass.

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:32.830
Wait! Look, it's the ransom! $700,000!

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:37.910
If I can see the hostages, I'll say where
the rest is hidden! Please!

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:49.290
Tristan!

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:56.790
You okay?

00:16:56.790 --> 00:17:03.410
Yeah... Appare, I know it's a lot to ask,
but I need you to distract him.

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:07.200
I'll try to do something before it's too late.

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:10.000
All right. I'll use my trump card.

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:12.910
We've only got one shot.

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:14.160
Right!

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:18.910
Sofia!

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:26.830
It's the ransom.

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:28.950
Where's the rest of it?

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:32.540
There ain't any money!

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:39.540
You... should be dead!

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:45.160
The better the shooter, the less they
check if you're actually dead.

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:48.450
Thanks for leading me here.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:54.250
I've gotta say, you're treating ladies
a lot differently now, Richard.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:05.290
Just so you know, the bag is full of newspaper!

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:08.200
--You little--
--What did I say to do?

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.580
Gil, this isn't...!

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:13.910
I'm asking you, "What did I say to do?"

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:15.330
To kill them?

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:17.120
Wrong!

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:27.160
I said to slaughter them!

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:32.950
Then I guess you're not gonna
let us waltz outta here.

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:34.000
Look!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.830
Yeah. You ready?

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:37.080
Let's go!

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:40.580
Nice try!

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:42.750
Distance, check!

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:44.410
It won't work! Give it up!

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:45.540
Now!

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:51.950
Hangetsu Ittoryu secret move!

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:57.370
Majestic Crimson Moon Halo!

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:11.950
What was that?

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:16.620
I made electricity run through it.
Anyways, you all right?

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:20.080
I'll manage. Let's keep moving.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:49.500
Under orders from Gil, I'm gonna slaughter you.

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:55.790
To achieve what others told me was impossible,

00:19:55.790 --> 00:20:00.200
I've gone against the tide
and overcome adversity!

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:11.410
If you think I'll be stopped by someone
like you who can only take orders...

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:15.750
...I've got some bad news for you!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:30.750
Who the hell... are you?

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:34.580
I'm Jing Xialian--a racer.

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:44.660
Stop it!

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:48.500
Such a pesky brat. You wanna die first?

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:56.120
Let him go.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:01.040
Don't you dare...

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:08.870
...hurt my friend!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.790
You okay?!

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.000
I'm one durable dude!

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:20.660
Thank you.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:21.790
Let's go!

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:22.790
Right!

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:33.450
Outta my way!

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:49.040
No way...

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:50.200
Al!

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:56.450
That's one of the hostages...

00:21:56.450 --> 00:22:00.250
I saw the white smoke signal. Sofia's alive.

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:01.410
Yeah.

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:02.870
Hey!

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:08.120
Guys! You all made it!

00:22:08.120 --> 00:22:11.830
So, Seth or Chase must have given the signal?

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:15.660
Sofia!

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:47.450
"Next time"

00:23:47.450 --> 00:23:49.910
"Episode 13"
"OVER THE MOON"
